          "text": "Ū Musa ūng'wīla, “Ūlū nalīnge a henaha nakūnomba ū SEEBA, ī ntondo gakwīnga a magi; gakūng'wīngīla ū Falao na a batūmami bakwe, pye na a banhū bakwe. Gwike dūhū ni ilang'hanage ū Falao, atizūtūmamīla būlomolomo hangī, abalemeje a banhū ū kūjūmfunīja shitambò ū SEEBA.” ",
